Package: libeditorconfig0
Version: @DEB_EDITORCONFIG_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Libraries
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://editorconfig.org/
Depends: libpcre2-8-0
Description: EditorConfig file parser library - runtime
 libeditorconfig locates and parses .editorconfig files, giving editors a uniform
 way to apply per-project coding-style settings. This package contains the shared
 library. Built from editorconfig-core-c.
